# Nothing the game writes is in here — saves, config, sprites and the PokeAPI
# response cache all live under ~/.claudemon. Two things that look ignorable and
# are not:
#
#   data/  the dataset the plugin ships, so installing needs no PokeAPI round trip
#   docs/  the screenshots the README shows
